# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# pnpm is the only supported package manager
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Only the *generated* dispatcher that `vp hooks enable` writes. The project-owned
# `.vite-hooks/pre-commit` is committed: ignoring the whole directory, as this
# first did, made that file impossible to commit and left the repository with no
# hook at all in any checkout, because the dispatcher exits 0 when it is missing.
.vite-hooks/_/

# testing
/coverage

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

